098,"like_count":32,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":6},"text":"史蒂夫·威特科夫周三称赞俄罗斯总统普京是一位“人道主义者”，令乌克兰及其支持者震惊，但那些密切关注威特科夫如何处理俄罗斯事务的人对此并不意外。https://t.co/LNMUNTWODg","url":"https://x.com/ChineseWSJ/status/2113133269671662032"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-22T05:00:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113133245483393306"],"id":"2113133245483393306","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":60,"impression_count":76063,"like_count":303,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":60,"retweet_count":10},"text":"“04年三胎宝妈”自述：打工十多个小时，生活费只有丈夫一半\n\n10月15日，一名自称“04年已婚三胎宝妈”的女子在抖音晒出在广东打工的日常。\n她早上7点上班、晚上8点半下班，回家还要给孩子洗澡、辅导作业、手洗衣服。 https://t.co/mIAY2rhds8 https://t.co/upJz3Y2ZJ5","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2113133245483393306"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-22T04:53:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113131671784472959"],"id":"2113131671784472959","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":8861,"like_count":40,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":7},"text":"老刘，53岁，北京外企高管，两口子年入150万。\n\n上个月，全家开销5794块。\n\n不够儿子在纽约花5天。\n\n儿子在纽约读美本，一年100万，每年一分不剩，全部花光。硕士还要再烧三年。\n\n老刘呢？四年没买过一件新衣服，三顿饭都靠公司食堂。老婆把车卖了，化妆品停了，外卖一个月200块，平均一天不到7块钱。","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2113131671784472959"},{"author_id":"39941478","created_at":"2026-10-22T04:47:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113130034248491335"],"id":"2113130034248491335","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":51759,"like_count":28,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":4},"text":"朝鲜领导人金正恩的妹妹金与正说，朝鲜将在数日内沿朝韩边境全线做好部署反韩扩音器的准备，并已对一些未具体说明的新反制措施发出待命指令。 https://t.co/OuHPuF9kTp","url":"https://x.com/zaobaosg/status/2113130034248491335"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-22T04:40:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113128211093582154"],"id":"2113128211093582154","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":21,"impression_count":42452,"like_count":150,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":